---
title: Step 3 — User views products (hotels)
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant R as routes/hotels
    participant C as controllers/hotels
    participant H as Hotel model

    U->>R: GET /hotels?sort=&page=&limit=
    R->>C: getHotels()
    C->>H: find().sort().skip().limit()
    H-->>C: hotels
    C-->>U: 200 {count, total, pagination, data: name, address, tel, ...}

    U->>R: GET /hotels/:id
    R->>C: getHotel()
    C->>H: findById(id)
    alt no hotel with this id
        C-->>U: 404 Hotel not found
    end
    C-->>U: 200 {data: hotel}
